WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,990 --> 00:00:04,910
What do you want to do without us?

2
00:00:04,910 --> 00:00:08,190
There's no way you guys would have the chance to do what you want, you say?

3
00:00:08,350 --> 00:00:09,670
We opened this door

4
00:00:09,910 --> 00:00:10,910
You want to go there

5
00:00:10,910 --> 00:00:12,670
Do you have to pay tolls?

6
00:00:12,990 --> 00:00:13,910
if it weren't for us

7
00:00:13,910 --> 00:00:15,190
You have been hanged to death long ago

8
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:16,790
Now they are blackmailing us

9
00:00:16,910 --> 00:00:17,870
Then I don't care

10
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:19,990
People die for wealth, birds die for food

11
00:00:20,190 --> 00:00:23,030
Hand over all the resources you have with you or else

12
00:00:24,670 --> 00:00:26,630
All you have to do is become a werewolf's dessert.

13
00:00:26,990 --> 00:00:28,950
Your current condition is not that good either.

14
00:00:28,950 --> 00:00:30,350
No chance

15
00:00:30,510 --> 00:00:32,270
He wants to close the door for just one second.

16
00:00:32,830 --> 00:00:33,900
But I can't help it

17
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:35,340
Kill you in a row in one second

18
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:37,300
Even if you transform into a soup wolf

19
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:38,580
The other police officer was shocked that he was so strong

20
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:39,700
Didn't lose control

21
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:40,940
In case of screw up

22
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:42,580
Even the last trump card was wasted

23
00:00:42,860 --> 00:00:43,900
Cheapness matters

24
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:45,020
Should be left to the wolves
